mal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 形成陡峭的「惩罚区」，阻止使用率触顶导致存款人无法取款。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>利率模型</th>\n<th>目标使用率</th>\n<th>特殊机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Compound v2</td>\n<td>分段线性</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>固定参数，治理调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aave v3</td>\n<td>分段线性 + eMode</td>\n<td>80-92%</td>\n<td>效率模式降低抵押率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aave v4</td>\n<td>模糊逻辑自适应</td>\n<td>动态调整</td>\n<td>Hub-Spoke 隔离风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Morpho Blue</td>\n<td>无治理利率</td>\n<td>按市场定</td>\n<td>利率由外部预言机驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Euler v2</td>\n<td>模块化 vault</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>每个 vault 独立利率逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"超额抵押与健康因子\">超额抵押与健康因子</h2><p>链上借贷的「无信任」特性要求超额抵押——借款人锁定的抵押品价值必须始终高于债务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HF = \\frac{\\sum (Collateral_i \\cdot Price_i \\cdot LTV_i)}{Debt_{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\