" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HF &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时触发清算。设计者需要在三个目标之间平衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资本效率</strong>：LTV 越高，用户杠杆越大，协议吸引力越强</li>\n<li><strong>安全边际</strong>：LTV 过高时，价格波动来不及触发清算就会产生坏账</li>\n<li><strong>清算延迟</strong>：链上 gas 竞争与 oracle 更新延迟构成清算时间窗口</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[抵押品价值下跌] --&gt; B{HF 低于清算阈值?}&#10;    B --&gt;|传统清算| C[清算人一次性购买&lt;br/&gt;50% 抵押品]&#10;    B --&gt;|渐进式清算 Aave v4| D[协议逐步转换&lt;br/&gt;抵押品为债务资产]&#10;    C --&gt; E[借款人损失&lt;br/&gt;清算罚金 5-15%]&#10;    D --&gt; F[借款人损失&lt;br/&gt;降低约 40%]&#10;    B --&gt;|HF 恢复| G[无清算发生]\">graph TD\n    A[抵押品价值下跌] --&gt; B{HF 低于清算阈值?}\n    B --&gt;|传统清算| C[清算人一次性购买&lt;br/&gt;50% 抵押品]\n    B --&gt;|渐进式清算 Aave v4| D[协议逐步转换&lt;br/&gt;抵押品为债务资产]\n    C --&gt; E[借款人损失&lt;br/&gt;清算罚金 5-15%]\n    D --&gt; F[借款人损失&lt;br/&gt;降低约 40%]\n    B --&gt;|HF 恢复| G[无清算发生]</pre><h2 id=\"渐进式清算-soft-liquidation\">渐进式清算（Soft Liquidation）</h2><p>Aave v4 引入的渐进式清算是 2026 年最重要的机制创新之一。与传统的「二元触发」清算不同，当头寸接近清算边界时，协议算法性地将抵押品逐步转换为借款资产：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>接近阈值时开始小比例转换（如每区块 0.1%）</li>\n<li>转换比例随偏离程度线性增加</li>\n<li>如果价格回升，转换停止，用户保留剩余头寸</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一设计灵感来源于 Curve 的 crvUSD LLAMMA 机制（Lending-Liquidating AMM Algorithm），但 Aave v4 通过更细粒度的治理参数控制和更深的 oracle 集成进行了扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flash-loan-作为原语\">Flash Loan 作为原语</h2><p>闪电贷是 DeFi 借贷协议的一个「涌现」原语——允许在单笔交易内借入任意数量的资产，只要在交易结束前归还本金 + 手续费。其设计约束只有一条：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">balance_{end} \\geq balance_{start} + fee</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>闪电贷使得套利、清算和自我清算无需启动资金，极大降低了市场效率的摩擦。但它也成为攻击向量——攻击者可以用零成本获取巨额资金操纵价格。协议设计者必须假设<strong>任何外部调用都可能在闪电贷上下文中发生</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离市场与模块化借贷\">隔离市场与模块化借贷</h2><p>2025-2026 年借贷协议的设计趋势是<strong>模块化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aave v4 Hub-and-Spoke</strong>：统一流动性 Hub 持有存款，多个 Spoke 定义独立的抵押规则和清算逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>Euler v2</strong>：每个 vault 是独立的借贷市场，可自定义 oracle、利率曲线、清算折扣</li>\n<li><strong>Morpho Blue</strong>：极简核心合约 + 无治理利率，由外部「MetaMorpho」vault 聚合流动性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些设计的共同目标是：<strong>在保持流动性深度的同时实现风险隔离</strong>——新的长尾资产不会把系统性风险传导给蓝筹抵押品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利率预言机与跨协议套利\">利率预言机与跨协议套利</h2><p>当多个借贷协议并存时，利率差异驱动资金流动。设计者需要考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>利率预言机（如 Morpho 的 IRM oracle）使利率跟随市场而非治理投票</li>\n<li>跨协议的利率套利会压平收益差，使所有协议趋向均衡利率</li>\n<li>稳定币发行方（如 GHO Direct）的零利率政策如何影响借贷市场定价</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>利率模型的核心任务是通过利率信号引导使用率趋向目标值</li>\n<li>渐进式清算比二元清算减少约 40% 的借款人损失</li>\n<li>模块化借贷（Hub-Spoke / Vault）在流动性统一与风险隔离间取得平衡</li>\n<li>闪电贷既是效率原语也是攻击工具，协议设计必须假设其存在</li>\n<li>利率预言机正在取代治理投票成为利率参数的决定因素</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"tokenomics-incentive-design\">代币经济学与激励设计</a>：理解借贷协议的代币激励如何与利率模型交互</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../fintech-fundamentals/defi-digital-assets/defi-protocols\">DeFi 协议概览</a>：回顾借贷协议的基本运作原理与历史演进</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"借贷协议设计与利率模型","id":"借贷协议设计与利率模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"利率模型的设计空间","id":"利率模型的设计空间"},{"level":2,"text":"超额抵押与健康因子","id":"超额抵押与健康因子"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式清算（Soft Liquidation）","id":"渐进式清算-soft-liquidation"},{"level":2,"text":"Flash Loan 作为原语","id":"flash-loan-作为原语"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离市场与模块化借贷","id":"隔离市场与模块化借贷"},{"level":2,"text":"利率预言机与跨协议套利","id":"利率预言机与跨协议套利"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"AMM 做市机制与定价曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations/amm-mechanics"},"next":{"title":"代币经济学与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/foundations/tokenomics-incentive-design"}}